\title{nbzinbPate: Negative Binomial and Zero-Inflated Negative Binomial Regression}
\description{
Fits negative binomial (NB2) regression by iteratively reweighted least squares (IRLS) for the regression coefficients, alternated with Newton-Raphson for the log dispersion parameter, and zero-inflated negative binomial (ZINB) regression by an EM algorithm whose M-steps are weighted IRLS fits. Standard errors for the ZINB model come from an analytic Hessian of the observed-data log-likelihood. No general-purpose optimizer is used.
}
